Description: add layered system configuration lookup
Source: downstream
Upstream: not submitted; needs agreement on Unix vendor and transient paths

Keep caller-supplied configuration paths unchanged.  When no path is supplied,
select the first main file from /etc, /run, or /usr/lib.  Treat the conventional
"include /etc/logrotate.d" directive as a basename merge across administrator,
transient, and vendor fragment directories.

